From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GSI Patch <gsi@local>
Date: Tue, 9 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Launcher3: Enable double tap to sleep by default

Upstream LineageOS already supports double-tap empty space on the
home screen to sleep (WorkspaceTouchListener -> QuickstepLauncher
-> SystemUiProxy), plus double-tap on status bar and anywhere on
the lock screen. The launcher toggle defaults to off, so users
think sleep only works from the navbar.

Default it to on for GSI so home-screen DT2S behaves like the
lock screen out of the box. Users can still turn it off in
Home Settings > Double tap to sleep.

---
 res/xml/launcher_preferences.xml          | 2 +-
 src/com/android/launcher3/LauncherPrefs.kt | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/res/xml/launcher_preferences.xml b/res/xml/launcher_preferences.xml
--- a/res/xml/launcher_preferences.xml
+++ b/res/xml/launcher_preferences.xml
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@
         android:summaryOff="@string/settings_lock_layout_summary_off" />

     <SwitchPreferenceCompat
-        android:defaultValue="false"
+        android:defaultValue="true"
         android:key="pref_sleep_gesture"
         android:persistent="true"
         android:title="@string/pref_sleep_gesture_title"
diff --git a/src/com/android/launcher3/LauncherPrefs.kt b/src/com/android/launcher3/LauncherPrefs.kt
--- a/src/com/android/launcher3/LauncherPrefs.kt
+++ b/src/com/android/launcher3/LauncherPrefs.kt
@@ -253,7 +253,7 @@
         @JvmField val WORKSPACE_LOCK = backedUpItem("pref_workspace_lock", false)
         @JvmField val ALLAPPS_THEMED_ICONS = backedUpItem("pref_allapps_themed_icons", false)
         @JvmField val DRAWER_OPEN_KEYBOARD = backedUpItem("pref_drawer_open_keyboard", false)
-        @JvmField val SLEEP_GESTURE = backedUpItem("pref_sleep_gesture", false)
+        @JvmField val SLEEP_GESTURE = backedUpItem("pref_sleep_gesture", true)
         @JvmField
         val PROMISE_ICON_IDS = nonRestorableItem(InstallSessionHelper.PROMISE_ICON_IDS, "")
         @JvmField val WORK_EDU_STEP = backedUpItem("showed_work_profile_edu", 0)
--
2.47.3
